From 8962ce9ce4a28db12561298634780ba021d23400 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jules Youngberg <julesdayoungberg@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 21:50:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] Adaptive folder counts, and a third folder level for
 renders

FOLDER_ADAPTIVE gives a category as many folders as its files need and
splits a folder over MAX_PER_FAMILY instead of leaving files out.
DIR_CAPS turns the per-category dir_cap off. A profile with
folder_depth 3 renders CATEGORY/group/family, the groups read from Live's
auto-tags, bands and family names (FOLDER_GROUPS).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
